    {
      "id": "claim_4b6a2a1a2fb548418433c69847ac9da8",
      "statement": "Both Jev call sites degrade gracefully and record the degradation in a status string instead of raising: without TYPESAFE_API_KEY or on an exception, triage.py keeps the first KEEP stories from the GDELT ranking with severity=None and sets jev_status accordingly, and verify.py runs only its code-side URL/number/date checks, assigns no sector to any claim, and sets verify_status accordingly.",
