      "statement": "Because a sector is required before prices.py will fetch any ETF data, a degraded verify.py run (no TYPESAFE_API_KEY or a Jev failure) results in no sectors on any claim, which causes prices.py:price to skip the Yahoo Finance download entirely and return empty moves.",
