    {
      "id": "claim_631917166bf342b1b26c369806026230",
      "statement": "Each Tavily search_news call searches topic='news' with max_results=5 over a 7-day window ending on as_of, and a per-topic closure counter enforces a cap of MAX_SEARCHES=3 calls, returning a fixed 'Search limit reached' message instead of calling Tavily beyond that; a full new-report run (3 severe stories) therefore makes at most 9 Tavily calls, and a follow-up run (1 topic) at most 3.",
      "evidence": [
